MODULE 1: HOW DO MACHINES LEARN?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION: 

- In this module, you’ll learn how machine learning—and its subset, deep learning—fit into the continuum
    of artificial intelligence. You’ll also explore three different approaches that data scientists take
    when training AI systems.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

- After completing this module, you should be able to:
    -> Distinguish between artificial intelligence, machine learning, and deep learning
    -> Describe supervised, unsupervised, and reinforcement learning